      "name": "borrowed_cursor_pair_preserves_both_rows_duplicates_and_asymmetric_eof",
      "scope": "Uses actual scratch schema and real next_pair, duplicates/signed-zero text/Unicode and20KiB row; checks A survives B step, both unequal lengths and empty A, repeated EOF, digest equality to owned ordered baseline, owned examples after statements drop."
